{
  "name": "feathered_dino_looming",
  "description": "Head and neck of a huge feathered theropod leaning in from the right edge, facing left: long toothy snout slightly open with sharp white teeth top and bottom (the gap is open, so the teeth read in silhouette), hard yellow slit eye under a heavy brow, shaggy brown #6a4a2a feathers (ragged mane behind the head and along the nape) with darker back and pale throat, thick neck running off the right edge. Same family look as feathered_dinosaur, but enormous. Anchor (0,0) = neck base on the right edge (cut edge at x=0, keep it off-frame); extents x -900..0, y -330..+265.",
  "anchor": [
    0,
    0
  ],
  "tags": [
    "dinosaur",
    "feathered dinosaur",
    "theropod",
    "boss",
    "looming",
    "cretaceous",
    "030"
  ],
